1619:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** DESCRIPTION:    Returns the byte count of data transferred.  This function
1620:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                is deprecated in favor of ftp_client_xfer(), which
1621:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                returns a long value.
1622:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1623:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                If the number of bytes transferred was over 0x7FFFFFFF, then
1624:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                this function returns 0x7FFFFFFFF which may be misleading.
1625:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1626:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** RETURN VALUE:   size, in bytes
1627:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1628:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** SEE ALSO:      ftp_client_setup, ftp_data_handler, ftp_client_xfer
1629:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1630:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** END DESCRIPTION **********************************************************/
