1672:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** DESCRIPTION:    Returns the most recent message code sent by the FTP
1673:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                server.  RFC959 describes the codes in detail.  This
1674:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                function is most useful for error diagnosis in the case
1675:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                that an FTP transfer failed.
1676:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1677:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** RETURN VALUE:   error code; a number between 0 and 999.  Codes less than
1678:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                100 indicate that an internal error occurred e.g.
1679:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c ****                the server was never contacted.
1680:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1681:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** SEE ALSO:      ftp_client_setup, ftp_client_tick
1682:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** 
1683:../src/middleware/ftp-client/FTP_CLIENT.c **** END DESCRIPTION **********************************************************/
